D12  IDEMPOTENCY - POS retry and double reversal
     Network timeouts make terminals resend; support staff may click 'reverse' twice.
==============================================================================
  [t+ 0.016s] POS       cash_out ref XD12000000001 committed as txn 1309733; response lost in the network
  [t+ 0.027s] POS       retry with same ref -> 23505 unique_violation (pos_transaction_txn_ref_key)
  [t+ 0.028s] POS       app returns original result instead: txn 1309733 SUCCESS - customer debited once
  [t+ 0.035s] after retry balances -> Ada N39,700.00 | Bayo N20,000.00 | Agent N310,000.00
  [t+ 0.044s] Officer1  reverse_txn -> reversal txn 1309735 COMMITTED
  [t+ 0.045s] Officer2  reverse_txn rejected: Txn 1309733 cannot be reversed (status REVERSED)
  [t+ 0.050s] after reversal balances -> Ada N50,000.00 | Bayo N20,000.00 | Agent N300,000.00
  [t+ 0.057s] CHECK     wallets whose balance disagrees with the ledger: 0

